WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,150 --> 00:00:05,330
Director Fang

2
00:00:05,530 --> 00:00:06,930
Is there any news about the loan?

3
00:00:09,260 --> 00:00:10,660
Three days means three days

4
00:00:10,660 --> 00:00:11,660
Not much more than a day

5
00:00:11,860 --> 00:00:14,260
How about Comrade Zhang Jianguo, I didn’t lie to you, did I?

6
00:00:14,860 --> 00:00:16,500
Look what you said

7
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:18,300
You are a public servant who eats from the public family

8
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:27,160
How can you deceive people by always saying one thing at a time? I went out to sea today, how was the harvest?

9
00:00:27,560 --> 00:00:29,360
I just caught more than 300 kilograms of prawns today.

10
00:00:30,220 --> 00:00:31,220
You kid can do it

11
00:00:31,420 --> 00:00:32,420
Using a small boat in Jinhai

12
00:00:32,420 --> 00:00:33,620
You can get so many good things

13
00:00:33,820 --> 00:00:39,070
If I buy a tin boat to go to a farther place in the future, it will not be developed enough to go farther.

14
00:00:39,070 --> 00:00:41,270
It’s definitely better than getting in and out, right?

15
00:00:41,470 --> 00:00:42,470
Can I buy a tin boat?

16
00:00:42,470 --> 00:00:50,370
Don’t we still have to rely on you? Eight thousand five hundred dollars is a penny a lot. Just check.

17
00:00:50,570 --> 00:00:56,780
That's five hundred more

18
00:00:56,980 --> 00:00:57,980
This five hundred is our director

19
00:00:57,980 --> 00:00:59,980
Talk to the original leader who is specifically fighting for it from your superiors.

20
00:00:59,980 --> 00:01:02,180
Why only give us 7,000 yuan? Our leader said that is not possible.

21
00:01:02,180 --> 00:01:03,180
Not working if less than 8,500

22
00:01:03,380 --> 00:01:04,380
The leader is so angry

23
00:01:04,580 --> 00:01:05,980
But our director keeps pestering him

24
00:01:06,480 --> 00:01:07,680
And followed him all the way to forty
